        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 4213, Two Piece Hamden Entry Door Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Hamden Handleset features the retro look of the 1920's, making it the perfect finishing touch for any mid-century modern home. The stepped design paired with your choice of classic finish gives this Hamden Entry Door Handleset an authentic feel. Choose from beautiful interior trim knobs and levers. This Two Piece Hamden Entry Door Lockset is available in dummy and single cylinder functions and comes as a complete set, packaged with everything you'll need to install it on a standard 2-1/8 inch prepped door. The Hamden Entrance Handleset will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Hamden Tubular Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Hamden Entrance Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Width: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Top Plate Height: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Top Plate Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Bottom Plate Height: 2-1/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 3\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 8-5/8\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-4213-specifications.pdf?v=1704262345\"><b>Emtek 4213 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Handle-B-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262345\"><b>Emtek Tubular Entryset Template Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
